<title>FRANCE: Rouen Dec 1-11 wheat exports at 346,506 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Dec 1-11 wheat exports at 346,506 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from Rouen reached 346,506 tonnes between December 1 and December 11, port officials said on Tuesday</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 381,000 tonnes in the whole of December 1995.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    South Africa		    17,000</p>
<p>    West Africa		     22,800</p>
<p>    Algeria			   25,100</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		  13,240</p>
<p>    Egypt			     26,260</p>
<p>    Finland			    2,920</p>
<p>    Britain			    8,020</p>
<p>    Italy			    126,299</p>
<p>    Morocco			   43,000</p>
<p>    Poland			    36,467</p>
<p>    Turkey			    25,400</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
